        "file": "src/pricing.py",
        "line": 7,
        "trigger": "Any call with discount_percent between 1 and 99, e.g. payable_total(1000, 10).",
        "evidence": "`return amount_cents * discount_percent // 100` computes the discount itself (100 for 1000 at 10%), whereas the docstring says it returns the amount payable after the discount.",
